Some definitions in this directory and in the driver's tests in
kernel/tests/graphics are re-declared from NVIDIA's open GPU kernel modules at
release 535.183.01 (https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules), and
each file holding one says so in its first line. Below are the files of the
open kernel modules they come from, what each gives, and its copyright line.

src/common/inc/swref/published/nv_ref.h
    PMC_BOOT_0 and its chip id and revision fields, in chip.h and chip.cpp
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 1993-2021 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES

src/common/inc/swref/published/turing/tu102/dev_ext_devices.h
    the ROM window's offset, in vbios.h
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2003-2022 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES

src/nvidia/inc/kernel/platform/pci_exp_table.h
    NVIDIA's image and PCI data signatures, and the signature and fields of
    NVIDIA's extension to the PCI data structure, in vbios.cpp and
    kernel/tests/graphics/nvidia.test.cpp
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 1993-2021 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.

src/nvidia/src/kernel/gpu/gsp/kernel_gsp.c
    the name of the GSP image's .fwversion section and the rule that it holds
    exactly the version string and its NUL, in firmware_files.cpp and
    kernel/tests/graphics/nvidia_firmware.test.cpp
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2019-2024 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.

nouveau/extract-firmware-nouveau.py
    the boot file header and its values, in firmware_files.h,
    firmware_files.cpp and kernel/tests/graphics/nvidia_firmware.test.cpp
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2023 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.

